			"type":"text",
			"text":"You can use the [[032 - Boiler Room.canvas|032 - Boiler Room]] to send power to the [[033 - Pump Room.canvas|033 - Pump Room]].\n\nThis enable you to use the reserve tank on the [[033 - Pump Room.canvas|033 - Pump Room]] to be able to move additional water around the tanks.\n\nThe main purpose of the reserve tank is to be able to drain the [[Reservoir.canvas|Reservoir]] completely on the [[Drain Reservoir.canvas|Drain Reservoir]] task.",
